    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="ed7e06a5-c63c-5119-a537-c6b190c49179" activityNameId="e3410303-ec83-55bf-8bbd-c4182147e85e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Acrylic filler, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Acrylic filler, at plant
Acrylates are part of a large family of diverse polyesters and acrylic fillers can contain varying amounts of different filler materials. This dataset stands for one specific acrylic filler ready to apply (including water) and should not be used for other acrylic fillers if their contribution to the overall result of an assessment might be relevant. The data quality is not sufficient to allow for e.g. a comparative assessment of different fillers.;
UUID: e4f40f05-7225-3438-a844-9d4309060168
Transport of raw materials and production of filler. The requirements of raw materials, the electricity and the infrastructure are inventoried. Packaging is neglected.
Location: data for Switzerland
Technology: The dataset models a mixing process with its electricity consumption.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Raw material consumption for a "typical" acrylic filler is chosen. Energy data are taken from a similar process. 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e4f40f05-7225-3438-a844-9d4309060168.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
